# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Git worktrees
.worktrees/

# Generated example output (STEP files, PNG renders)
examples/output/

# Personal prompt log (not committed)
.prompt-log/

# Local task ledger (schema/tooling is committed; state is intentionally local)
.popkern/

# Maintainer-local material: research papers and books, design notes,
# journals and generated reports. Kept on the maintainer's machine, not
# published. Tracked files under docs/architecture/ and docs/reference/
# stay tracked; a new public doc there needs `git add -f`.
docs/papers/
docs/books/
docs/code/
docs/architecture/
docs/reference/
docs/atlas/
docs/decisions/
docs/journal/
docs/notes/
docs/reports/
docs/requirements/
docs/superpowers/
docs/images/
flowcharts/
probes/

# Local coding-agent state (the shared guide is AGENTS.md)
.claude/
.codex/

__pycache__/
*.swp
core.[0-9]*

# Local Telegram notifier and its credentials.
#
# `notify.sh` holds no secret itself, but `.env` holds the bot token and
# chat id. Both were previously ignored only via `.git/info/exclude`,
# which is local and uncommitted — a fresh clone would not inherit it and
# could commit the token. Keep these rules here, in the committed file.
/notify.sh
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
target-wt/

# Built wasm bundle of popkern live (tools/build-live.sh)
web/live/pkg/
web/live/bakes/

# wrangler's per-project cache (tools/dist-*.sh --upload run it from the root)
.wrangler/

# Local video source material (not committed, like docs/images/input/)
docs/videos/

# Scratch diagnostic probes (project rule: probes are removed or promoted
# before commit, never committed as they stand)
**/tests/**/zz_probe*
**/tests/zz_probe*
